    "detailed_description": "<strong>For video creators and streamers</strong><br>STP WORKS permits the use of our games for video distribution to YouTube and other sites, and monetization through video distribution platform partner programs.<br><br><strong>Game Overview</strong><br>Experience the thrill of a Japanese festival with a unique twist! This online co-op game combines the fun of &quot;Ball Scooping&quot; (like goldfish scooping, but with balls!) and &quot;Shooting Gallery&quot; games. Scoop up balls and launch them at prize targets to win a variety of goodies and items. The items you snag can boost your money, trigger special events, and more!<br><br><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Dive into the action with Quick Match, which automatically connects you to available games for spontaneous fun. Or, team up with your friends using Friend Match for a private party. Of course, solo play is also fully supported, so you can enjoy the game at your own pace. Up to 4 players can play together!<br><br><strong>Leaderboards</strong><br>Compete against other players on the leaderboards to see who can progress the furthest in events.<br><br><strong>Cooperative Events</strong><br>Take part in exciting co-op events like monster hunts and mini-games such as &quot;Barrel Drop.&quot; Monsters scale in difficulty based on player strength, offering increasingly challenging encounters. The tougher the monster, the better the rewards!<br><br><strong>Upgrades</strong><br>Power up your gameplay with a wide range of upgrades! Unlock shotguns, gatling guns, expand your scooper's size, boost its durability, and much more.<br><br><strong>Prizes</strong><br>The more you collect a specific prize, the higher its level becomes, increasing the amount of money you earn from it.",
